# .understandignore — patterns for files/dirs to exclude from analysis
# Syntax: same as .gitignore (globs, # comments, ! negation, trailing / for dirs)
#
# Built-in defaults (always excluded unless negated):
#   node_modules/, .git/, dist/, build/, obj/, *.lock, *.min.js, etc.
#
# This repo's root contains vendored agent tooling and superseded design docs
# that are NOT part of the ETF Allocator project. They are actively excluded
# below so the knowledge graph reflects the real codebase.

# --- This skill's own output (do not analyze the analyzer) ---
.understand-anything/

# --- Vendored agent skill/command tooling (NOT the project) ---
.agents/
.claude/
.cline/
.clinerules/
.codex/
.opencode/
.playwright-mcp/
.playwright/
.sisyphus/
.gstack/
.pytest_cache/

# --- OpenSpec workflow tooling (process artifacts, not project code) ---
openspec/

# --- Superseded / scratch design docs at root ---
# ds.v1.3.md is the canonical design spec and IS included.
# These are older iterations AGENTS.md says are replaced:
claude.v1.2.md
ds.md
ds.v1.2.winner.md
gpt.md

# --- Large binary / non-source artifacts at root ---
*.html
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.svg
*.ico
nul

# --- Build / cache / data artifacts ---
ETF-Allocator/dashboard/dist/
ETF-Allocator/dashboard/node_modules/
